{"unit_id":"zhangguiping-xydt__dsh-possibility-space#card-zh","repo":"zhangguiping-xydt/dsh-possibility-space","commit":"f951698147c2328426020a6cecc5204887e3f4ee","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-possibility-space 是面向 DSH Web 的交互式回答探索插件。它在每条已完成的助手回答下方加入语义地图入口，先为回答推导三个取舍维度，再让用户选两个维度并拖动坐标，按需生成对应版本。用户可以锁定原文段落或添加约束，查看与原回答的差异、回到版本轨迹中的旧方案，并复制选中的回答、保存坐标偏好。适合希望比较不同方案方向的写作、设计、代码架构和决策场景。它沿用原回答的模型来源，通过 DSH 适配器调用模型；不需要单独的 API Key，需 DSH 0.1.1-rc.2 或更新版本。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.tsx:33-47","src/client/index.tsx:120-140","src/server.ts:416-474","README.md:13-37"]}
{"unit_id":"zhangguiping-xydt__dsh-possibility-space#card-en","repo":"zhangguiping-xydt/dsh-possibility-space","commit":"f951698147c2328426020a6cecc5204887e3f4ee","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-possibility-space lets DSH Web users explore an answer as a two-axis semantic map. It infers trade-off axes, generates a version at the chosen point, and supports paragraph locks, diffs, history, and saved preferences. It uses the answer’s configured DSH model; no separate API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.tsx:33-47","src/client/index.tsx:120-140","src/server.ts:416-474","README.md:13-37"]}
